{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24013","headline":"南龙兴寺残雪 · 白居易","name":"南龙兴寺残雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南龙兴寺春晴後，缓步徐吟绕四廊。\n老趂风花应不称，闲寻松雪正相当。\n吏人引从多乘轝，宾客逢迎少下堂。\n不拟人间更求事，些些疎嬾亦何妨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24013.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24013","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}